# Log File Analyzer

A Python CLI tool to analyze log files, filter logs by date range, and generate summary reports in CSV format. The repo covers two things: parsing structured log files, and building a filtered CSV summary by severity level.

---

## Project 1: Log Parsing & Filtering

### What I Used

| Component | What It Was |
|-----------|-------------|
| Language | Python 3.6+ |
| Library | colorama |
| Input | Structured log files |
| Output | CSV summary report |
| Interface | Command-line (CLI) |
| Filter | Date-range filtering |
| Counting | Severity level (INFO/WARN/ERROR) |

